</div>
<para>Consider two equations in a system:</para>
<div class="os-raise-d-flex os-raise-justify-content-between">
  <para>\( \left\{ \begin{array}{c l} 4x+ y=1\\ x+2y=9 \end{array}\right. \)</para>
  <para>Equation A</para>
</div>
