<!--Q10-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>Make a couple of observations about the graphs of Equations A1, A2, and A3.</para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here: </para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para> Your answer may vary, but here is a sample. No new graphs appeared. The graphs of the equivalent equations are identical to that of Equation A. The graphs all intersect the graph of Equation B at \((-1,5)\).</para>
